 text-primary-100/90\">پیلاتس</li><li class=\"text-sm text-primary-100/90\">زومبا</li><li class=\"text-sm text-primary-100/90\">TRX</li><li class=\"text-sm text-primary-100/90\">فیتنس رقص</li><li class=\"text-sm text-primary-100/90\">حرکات کششی</li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-accent-light\">تماس با ما</h3><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-3 text-sm text-primary-100/90\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-4 w-4 text-accent-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span dir=\"ltr\">۰۲۱-۱۲۳۴۵۶۷۸</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-4 w-4 text-accent-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>تهران، خیابان نمونه، پلاک ۱۲</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-primary-700/60 bg-primary-900 py-4\"><p class=\"container-site text-center text-xs text-primary-100/80\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> باشگاه آوا — تمامی حقوق محفوظ است.</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-1ccb984bef8932a9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/be242b31a49bf824.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"